window.GAS_LABELS={"title":"L1 Gas Impact","eyebrow":"ETHEREUM / EXECUTION GAS","headline":"How much Ethereum L1 gas do selected apps & chains use?","intro":"Actual gas units. Six months of L1 execution activity directly attributable to selected top L1 apps, L2s & other chains.","snapshot":"Research snapshot","through":"Through","period":"Period","days7":"7 days","days30":"30 days","months6":"6 months","language":"Language","download":"Download data","methodology":"Methodology & coverage","comparison":"Measured L1 execution gas per day directly attributable to each app or chain","axis":"Million gas / day · highest first · linear scale from zero","scopeWarning":"Product figures are lower bounds from verified direct activity. Coverage differs; shared or unresolved activity is excluded.","plainTransfers":"ETH transfers","average":"Average per day","total":"Total gas","transactions":"Transactions","change":"Last 30 days vs previous 30","choose":"Select a product for its breakdown and history.","selected":"Selected product","history":"Measured L1 execution gas per day attributable to this app or chain","rolling":"7-day average","daily":"Daily","inspect":"Inspect date","breakdown":"Where {product}’s L1 gas went over {period}","gas":"Gas","gasPerDay":"gas / day","gasShare":"Share of measured gas","operations":"Chain & protocol operations","bridge":"Deposits & withdrawals","approvals":"Token approvals","governance":"Token & governance","defi":"DeFi activity","transfers":"Plain ETH transfers","other":"Other direct calls","coverage":"Coverage","sources":"Source queries","records":"Daily records","exactData":"Exact values","product":"Product","date":"Date (UTC)","noData":"No observation","periodTotal":"Selected-period total","equivalent":"Equivalent plain ETH transfers per day","equivalentNote":"Execution gas divided by 21,000. This compares gas demand, not transaction usefulness.","historyNote":"The line uses a trailing seven-day mean. Daily values remain available by date and in the data export.","measurementHeading":"What is measured","measurementBody":"Ethereum L1 receipt gas used, including intrinsic gas and the execution portion of blob transactions. Blob gas, native execution on other chains, gas prices and fees are excluded. Attributable failed transactions are included; the ETH-transfer benchmark includes successful transfers only.","attributionHeading":"What qualifies","attributionBody":"Transactions to verified, exclusive product contracts; operator transactions matched to their dedicated inbox; and token approvals matched to an exclusive spender. A shared bridge operator or router address alone is insufficient. The exported queries define the measured scope.","limitsHeading":"What is still outside the count","limitsBody":"Shared bridge settlements and governance, unresolved aggregator routes, undiscovered contracts and unclassified internal calls are excluded. Uniswap covers selected routers and liquidity entrypoints, not every pool interaction. Native ETH bridge finalizations with unverified callbacks are excluded. Omissions are not zeros.","verificationHeading":"How to check it","verificationBody":"Expanded contract and bridge cohorts are reconciled by transaction hash and by daily gas and count across two indexes. Chain-specific routes are ABI-decoded; disputed records are checked against canonical Ethereum receipts and blocks. Remaining original aggregate cohorts use sampled receipt checks. This is not a full independent recount of Ethereum.","scope_eth":"Successful, positive-value, empty-calldata Ethereum transactions using exactly 21,000 gas. Internal ETH transfers and smart-account transactions are outside this benchmark. This contextual benchmark can overlap incidental ETH movements associated with a product; do not sum the comparison rows.","scope_lighter":"Primary instance only: settlement, proofs, state execution, direct users, exclusive helpers, administration and approvals. Included receipts cover {depositIncluded} of {depositTotal} deposit parent transactions and {withdrawIncluded} of {withdrawTotal} withdrawal-claim parents. Unresolved external wrappers remain excluded; these fractions measure transaction coverage, not gas coverage. Excludes Lighter on Robinhood.","scope_uniswap":"Selected Ethereum deployments of V2, V3 and V4, including shared-version routers and liquidity entrypoints. Cross-version routers remain a combined bucket. Unresolved aggregator, legacy NFT-router and direct-pool routes are excluded.","scope_base":"Ethereum transactions to verified Base contracts plus the dedicated batch-submission route. User bridge activity is counted where the L1 entrypoint is identifiable. Unresolved helper contracts, dispute-game clones and mixed bridge routes are excluded.","scope_arbitrum":"Ethereum activity directly attributable to Arbitrum One’s dedicated contracts. Arbitrum Nova, other Orbit instances and governance shared across several products are excluded.","scope_robinhood":"Robinhood’s direct Ethereum-settled L2 and identifiable bridge activity. Its observed contracts begin April 30, 2026, before mainnet launch. Six-month averages include earlier days with no observed attributable activity. Arbitrum One activity is not allocated to Robinhood.","sourceNote":"Raw source labels and addresses are preserved in the downloads. Transaction receipt CSVs are preserved in a separate archive; their checksums and verification are included here.","freshness":"This is a fixed research snapshot, not a live feed.","readData":"Read the data","backToTop":"Back to comparison","daysUnit":"days","millionGas":"Million gas","dataArchive":"Original data & evidence (ZIP)","dailyCsv":"Daily data (CSV)","jsonData":"Structured data (JSON)","queryManifest":"Query manifest","batch_submission":"Batch submission","settlement":"State & proof operations","commit_batch":"Batch commitment","verify_batch":"Proof verification","execute_batch":"Batch execution","deposits":"Deposits","withdrawals":"Withdrawals","emergency":"Forced & emergency actions","v2_router":"V2 routers & liquidity","v3_router":"V3 router","mixed_router":"Mixed-version routers","liquidity":"Liquidity management","pool_creation":"Pool creation","cctp_bridge":"CCTP transfers","across_bridge":"Across deposits","governance_token":"Token & governance","token_approvals":"Token approvals","canonical_bridge":"Native bridge","dedicated_token_bridge":"Dedicated token bridges","verificationScope":"Verification scope","fullReceipts":"Full receipt reconciliation","aggregateSamples":"Provider aggregates + receipt checks","detailsHeading":"Activity","coveredWindow":"Full queried interval; days with no activity count as zero within the included scope.","deployments":"Contract deployments","account_controls":"Account controls","withdrawal_requests":"Withdrawal requests","withdrawal_claims":"Withdrawal claims","ofEthGas":"of ETH-transfer gas","ofUniswapGas":"of measured Uniswap on L1 gas","atLeast":"At least","exclusive_wrappers":"Dedicated deposit & withdrawal helpers","pageTitleSuffix":"Measured Execution Gas per Day by Selected Apps & Chains","uniswapName":"Uniswap on L1","lighterName":"Lighter (primary instance)","theme":"Theme","theme_system":"System","theme_light":"Light","theme_dark":"Dark","scope_worldchain":"World Chain only; unrelated World ID and WLD activity is excluded. Identified Ethereum batch submissions, settlement proposals, canonical bridge activity, selected approvals and chain-specific Across/CCTP transfers. Shared Superchain governance, dynamic dispute-game calls and unresolved routes are excluded.","scope_unichain":"Unichain, Uniswap’s rollup. This is separate from Uniswap on L1; execution on Unichain itself is L2 gas and is excluded. Identified Ethereum batch submissions, settlement proposals, canonical bridge activity, selected approvals and chain-specific Across/CCTP transfers. Shared Superchain governance, dynamic dispute-game calls and unresolved routes are excluded.","scope_op":"OP Mainnet only, not the whole Superchain. Identified Ethereum batch submissions, settlement proposals, canonical bridge activity, selected approvals and chain-specific Across/CCTP transfers. Shared Superchain governance, dynamic dispute-game calls and unresolved routes are excluded.","scope_ink":"Ink, the rollup launched by Kraken. Identified Ethereum batch submissions, settlement proposals, canonical bridge activity, selected approvals and chain-specific Across/CCTP transfers. Shared Superchain governance, dynamic dispute-game calls and unresolved routes are excluded.","withdrawal_proofs":"Withdrawal proofs","allAltL1s":"All alt L1s","coveredChains":"{count} covered chains","aggregateNote":"“All” covers only tracked chains. Fixed groups use the Sep 27, 2026 design: rollups publish data to Ethereum; non-rollups use external data availability. Historical gas stays with that group, including before migrations. Codex is unclassified and excluded from both L2 sums. Alt L1s includes Polygon PoS; EDGE (L3) is excluded. Subtotals overlap their members.","chartPeriod":"Chart period","earlierWindow":"Earlier window","laterWindow":"Later window","resetZoom":"Reset zoom","fromDate":"From","toDate":"To","chartHelp":"Hover or tap for daily values. Drag to zoom; use dates or arrows to move the window. Keyboard: left/right to inspect, Home/End to jump. Values are Ethereum L1 gas, not native chain gas.","scope_l2_generic":"Selected dedicated Ethereum contracts and decoded chain-specific bridge routes. Shared proof systems, governance, arbitrary L1 callbacks and unresolved routes are excluded. Coverage is a lower bound; consult the manifest for the exact contracts and methods.","scope_alt_generic":"Ethereum-side bridge transactions decoded for this chain. Native chain execution is excluded. Shared settlement, unresolved routes and unverified L1 callbacks are excluded; this is not a complete bridge footprint.","scope_app_generic":"Selected Ethereum contracts and reviewed direct methods. Aggregator routes, flash-loan callbacks, arbitrary execution and unreviewed methods are excluded. Token activity is included where identified; this is a lower bound, not complete protocol usage.","wormhole_bridge":"Wormhole transfers","dln_bridge":"DeBridge DLN transfers","lending":"Lending","staking":"Staking & savings","token_activity":"Protocol token activity","receiptCsv":"Receipt CSV","scope_l3_generic":"Ethereum-side bridge transactions decoded for EDGE Chain. EDGE is an L3 settling through Arbitrum; no portion of shared Arbitrum settlement is assigned to it. Native execution and unresolved bridge routes are excluded.","scope_polygon":"Polygon PoS checkpoints, reviewed staking and deposit calls, and decoded chain-specific bridges on Ethereum. Polygon PoS is a sidechain and is grouped with other non-L2 chains. Unverified exits and arbitrary state messages are excluded.","scope_hyperliquid":"Ethereum-side CCTP, Across, Wormhole and DLN routes identified for Hyperliquid / HyperEVM. Native Hyperliquid execution and its Arbitrum bridge are excluded; shared Arbitrum settlement is not allocated to Hyperliquid.","scope_starknet":"Direct Starknet state updates, selected StarkGate contracts and decoded Ethereum bridge routes. Shared SHARP proof transactions are excluded; no fraction of shared proofs is estimated.","scope_zksync2":"Chain-identified Ethereum settlement and reviewed deposits and bridges. Shared Gateway proof or settlement transactions are excluded; the total is a lower bound.","scope_aztecnetwork":"Current and previous Aztec Network rollup contracts, reviewed operator/governance methods and deposits. Legacy zk.money is a different product and is excluded; unresolved routes and arbitrary execution are excluded.","noActivity":"No measured activity in this period.","l1AppName":"{app} on L1","scopeIncludes":"Included: {scope}.","allL2Rollups":"All L2 rollups","allL2NonRollups":"All L2 non-rollups","l2Classification":"L2 classifications","viewImage":"View image","closeImage":"Close","receiptIndex":"Receipt archive index"};